1. COUNT() – Records count karna
SELECT COUNT(*) FROM users;

2. SUM() – Total nikalna
SELECT SUM(salary) FROM employees;

3. AVG() – Average nikalna
SELECT AVG(salary) FROM employees;

4. MAX() – Maximum value
SELECT MAX(salary) FROM employees;

5. MIN() – Minimum value
SELECT MIN(salary) FROM employees;



| Function  | Meaning       |
| --------- | ------------- |
| `COUNT()` | Total records |
| `SUM()`   | Total         |
| `AVG()`   | Average       |
| `MAX()`   | Maximum       |
| `MIN()`   | Minimum       |


